<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21148" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρῠώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full of seaweed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				543b1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ β.</span>, =
			<i>seaweed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				2.22.2
			</span></i>; of a ship, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἐπιπάγους προσάγεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.641e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> '<i>mossy',
				flabby</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὰρξ πλαδαρὸς καὶ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					2.62
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.195
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.82
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				95
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>catkin-like</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.87
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				4.181
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσώδης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
